<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Thick Coat</ansi> mutation

A dense pelt of coarse fur grows in over your whole body, trapping
warmth and turning the bite of wind and cold.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Uncommon

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Greater endurance against cold and rough country, and the matted coat
  turns aside a little of any blow that lands

